From bd95a0318e6970aa398ae98bba0b0738307670ad Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 12:51:35 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ui): operation picking is a mode - other tabs lock the
 selection

Viewport clicks change an operation's geometry only on its Geometry tab
(or with a pick row armed). Elsewhere the click is swallowed, hover and the
pick box stand down, and the dialog says Picking on / off.

Fixes #1514

